    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d2">

                <pb facs="0090" n="2" sameAs="frus:frus1933v04/pg2"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">710.G/125: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Argentina</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Bliss</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Buenos
                                Aires</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-02-09T13:00:00-03:00">February 9, 1933—1
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 4:52 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>17. Your 9, February 8, noon.<anchor n="3" xml:id="d2-f1"/> Member of Chilean
                    delegation at Mendoza conference tells me no question was raised regarding
                    postponement Pan American Conference, only desirability of accord on subjects to
                    be discussed. See paragraph 6 enclosure 1 my despatch No. 1957, February
                        3d.<anchor n="4" xml:id="d2-f2"/> I understand no agreement yet reached
                    regarding definite topics of the program.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Bliss</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
